{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the soundtrack from Boxville 2 game. Enjoy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All soundtracks were crafted specially for Boxville to express the mood of every location. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since our game is about cans and boxes, we have used real cardboard boxes, cans, wood, metal, water - there are no synthesized sounds in Boxville. We broke, cut, rustled, banged iron cans, cardboard boxes, kitchen utensils to get a unique sound. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrack is in MP3 and WAV formats. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boxville 2 game is not included.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720840?t=1750932190","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3720840?t=1750932190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720840/cac9b575996b8f40aaaa7d5ffeca14994d33d4e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750932190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3720840/cac9b575996b8f40aaaa7d5ffeca14994d33d4e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750932190","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the soundtrack from Boxville 2 game. Enjoy! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All soundtracks were crafted specially for Boxville to express the mood of every location. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since our game is about cans and boxes, we have used real cardboard boxes, cans, wood, metal, water - there are no synthesized sounds in Boxville. We broke, cut, rustled, banged iron cans, cardboard boxes, kitchen utensils to get a unique sound. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soundtrac